        {
          "sender_id": "u_liang",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "问个事，跨境结算的对账一般是 T+1 还是 T+0？我们通道方给的是 T+1，财务有点意见。",
          "timestamp": 1783978800000
        },
        {
          "sender_id": "assistant_daily",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "两种都有，取决于通道方的清算安排：T+0 需要预置备付金垫资，成本更高；T+1 是行业更普遍的做法。财务在意的通常是资金占用天数，可以让通道方给一份 settlement cut-off time 说明，很多时候 T+1 的实际到账比想象的早。",
          "timestamp": 1783978845000
        },
        {
          "sender_id": "u_liang",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "ValueError: max() arg is an empty sequence\n  File \"/app/settle/reconcile.py\", line 88, in latest_batch\n    return max(b.closed_at for b in batches)\n  reconcile_daily(batches=[], cutoff=None)",
          "timestamp": 1783978890000
        },
        {
          "sender_id": "assistant_daily",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "`batches` 是空序列时 `max()` 就会这样抛。给它一个 default 就行：`max((b.closed_at for b in batches), default=None)`，然后在调用方处理 None。空批次在对账里通常意味着当天没有清算，属于正常状态而不是异常，所以别用 try/except 吞掉。",
          "timestamp": 1783978935000
        },
        {
          "sender_id": "u_liang",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "makes sense. btw is `settlement cut-off time` the standard term? our vendor doc writes it as `cutoff`, 我怕对外文档不一致。",
          "timestamp": 1783978980000
        },
        {
          "sender_id": "assistant_daily",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "行业文档里两种拼法都有，ISO 20022 相关材料多用 `cut-off time`，供应商合同里写 `cutoff` 也不算错。对外统一成一种就行，建议跟合同保持一致。",
          "timestamp": 1783979025000
        },
        {
          "sender_id": "u_liang",
          "role": "user",
          "content": "懂了，我让后端改。周末我要陪孩子去打疫苗，周一再看。",
          "timestamp": 1783979070000
        },
        {
          "sender_id": "assistant_daily",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "好，周一见。疫苗那天要是想起来什么随时说。",
          "timestamp": 1783979115000
        }
      ]
    },
